<section class="page"><h1>Privacy</h1><div class="panel"><p>V2 stores your username, email, password hash, expiring sessions, favorites, and viewing history in an isolated database. Direct playback stores position and duration; embeds are recorded as recently opened.</p><p>You can clear viewing history or delete your account. Session cookies are HttpOnly and are never stored in browser local storage.</p><p>Images and embedded players can connect your browser to third-party providers. Their privacy policies apply. The application cannot read private playback state inside third-party iframes.</p><p>Local development reset messages are saved in private storage, never exposed over HTTP. Configure production email delivery before publishing.</p></div></section>
